  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "想在阳台上打造一个遮挡烈日的户外座椅区？不妨用设计巧妙的凉篷！宜家 DYNING 黛林 凉篷选用优质布料，能有效遮挡太阳紫外线，UPF（紫外线防护系数）达25以上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40125786",
    "70322101",
    "00352295"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/07/ec/07ec2a09f8e3c63795112e42e912d8e0.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/07/ec/07ec2a09f8e3c63795112e42e912d8e0.jpg",
     "text": ""
